  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.108 - member-anchored rules no longer crash on project-referenced models\n - AM001/AM004/AM005/AM006/AM011 now anchor at the CreateMap invocation when a mapped member is declared in a referenced project\n - Reporting a location from another compilation's syntax tree threw ArgumentException and surfaced as AD0001\n - No rule ID or severity changes",
